            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In the article by Sheikh SI, et al, &quot;Racial differences in pet ownership in families of children with asthma&quot; in World Journal of Pediatrics 2016;12(3):343-346 (doi: 10.1007/s12519-016-0027-9), the last author's name was incorrectly listed as &quot;Don Hayes&quot;. His name should have read &quot;Don Hayes Jr&quot;.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
